{"4239980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cube Dodger 3D", "steam_appid": 4239980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4243450, 4243460, 4243470, 4243480, 4243490, 4243500, 4243510, 4243520, 4243530, 4243540, 4243550, 4243560], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Dodger 3D is a high-speed, neon-soaked arcade runner about pure survival. You pilot a glowing cube ship down an endless highway while waves of enemy cubes get faster, larger, and smarter the longer you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, brutal difficulty, and a ridiculous rank ladder make every run a tight, score-chasing challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, responsive left/right movement and a one-button shield</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty: cubes speed up, grow, and gain moving / homing behavior as you progress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Garage with score-unlock ships, premium cosmetics, and a legendary shield-heavy ship</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Garage and Enemy Garage to customize the look of the highway and cubes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local saves only: high scores, unlocks, and equipped cosmetics live on your machine</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements for ship-specific score milestones and an extreme 1000-point goal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ads, no online accounts, and no grind passes—just you, your reflexes, and an endless wall of cubes trying to end the run.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cube Dodger 3D is a high-speed, neon-soaked arcade runner about pure survival. You pilot a glowing cube ship down an endless highway while waves of enemy cubes get faster, larger, and smarter the longer you stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple controls, brutal difficulty, and a ridiculous rank ladder make every run a tight, score-chasing challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fast, responsive left/right movement and a one-button shield</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic difficulty: cubes speed up, grow, and gain moving / homing behavior as you progress</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ship Garage with score-unlock ships, premium cosmetics, and a legendary shield-heavy ship</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Road Garage and Enemy Garage to customize the look of the highway and cubes</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local saves only: high scores, unlocks, and equipped cosmetics live on your machine</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam achievements for ship-specific score milestones and an extreme 1000-point goal</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no ads, no online accounts, and no grind passes—just you, your reflexes, and an endless wall of cubes trying to end the run.</p>", "short_description": "Cube Dodger 3D is a fast, neon arcade runner. Slide along a glowing highway, dodge smarter and faster cubes, charge your shield, unlock ships, roads and enemy skins, and chase brutal score-based Steam achievements", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239980/ed64d2d3558f7850e95c3528fe7db1d94610fdb4/header.jpg?t=1766572512", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239980/acada53852a4e40616c992290dc736a94013f35d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766572512", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4239980/acada53852a4e40616c992290dc736a94013f35d/c